era-rsf:10 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Rolling stock which is designed and built to operate on underground sections and tunnels of not more than 5 km in length, with side evacuation available is defined as category A"@en ;
    skos:inScheme era-rsf:Categories ;
