                                     LOC&PAS TSI : 4.2.10.4.4""" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf era:tunnelDataParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote """Data shall include both the category and brief name of the document introducing the categorisation.
A value is mandatory only for tunnels when the value of the parameter 1.1.1.1.8.10 is  none  and national rules exist.
It may be not applicable when respective national rules do not exist"""@en .

era:nationalValuesBrakeModel a owl:DatatypeProperty,
        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:label "National Values used for the brake model"@en ;
    era:applicable "Y/N/NYA" ;
    era:dependencyNote "A value has to be provided when ETCS is present (a value is provided on 1.1.1.3.2.1)."@en ;
    era:legalDeadline "12 months after publication of Article 7 Guide"@en ;
    era:rinfIndex "1.1.1.3.2.16.13",
        "1.2.1.1.1.16.13" ;
