With the extension of scope according to Interoperability Directive 2016/797, geographical scope of the INF, ENE and CCS TSIs now includes all the networks (TEN and off-TEN) with the following nominal track gauges: 1435, 1520, 1524, 1600 and 1668 mm """@en .

