    dcterms:source <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2018/545/art_14/oj/eng#> ;
    rdfs:comment """The request, as submitted by the Applicant in line with (EU)2018/545, to allow the vehicle type authorisation and/or the vehicle authorisation for placing on the market.
The application consists of one or more authorisation cases as described in Art. 14 of (EU)2018/545, and for authorisations before the Fourth Railway Package, a HistoricalAuthorisationCase must be used.

The outcome of the application process is a `era:VehicleAuthorisation` or `era:VehicleTypeAuthorisation`."""@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy era: ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/vpa#Request> ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" .

