era:VehicleRegistrationCase a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vehicle Registration Case"@en ;
    dcterms:created "2025-03-18"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:source <http://data.europa.eu/eli/dec_impl/2018/1614/2018-10-26> ;
    rdfs:comment """Vehicle Registrations can be created and modified using a specific Registration Case as listed in `3.2.2.   Registration cases` of the EVR Decision.

Each registration case will have as its scope:
- a set of vehicles of which the registration needs creating/updating.
- if present, the authorisation delivered for these vehicles and/or vehicle type to which they belong."""@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy era: ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/vpa#Case> ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" .

era:VehicleRegistrationRestriction a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vehicle Registration Restriction"@en ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/VehicleRegistrationRestrictionShape> ;
    dcterms:created "2025-07-15"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:comment "An `era:Restriction` which originates from a compliance check during the Vehicle's Registration."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy era: ;
    rdfs:subClassOf era:Restriction .

era:VehicleTypeAuthorisationCase a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vehicle Type Authorisation Case"@en ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/VehicleTypeAuthorisationCaseShape> ;
    dcterms:created "2025-02-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-01-29"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:source <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2018/545/art_14/oj/eng#> ;
    rdfs:comment """The process, as selected by the Applicant in line with (EU)2018/545, allowing the vehicle type authorisation and/or the vehicle authorisation for placing on the market.
The type of authorisation cases are described in Art. 14 of (EU)2018/545, and for authorisations before the Fourth Railway Package, a HistoricalAuthorisationCase must be used.

Each authorisation case supports a VehicleTypeAuthorisationApplication and is determined by exactly one VehicleType, and a set of Vehicles, which can be empty in some cases.

For authorisations before the (EU)2018/545 legislation, use `era:VehicleAuthorisationCase."""@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy era: ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/vpa#Case> ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" .

era:VehicleTypeAuthorisationRestriction a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vehicle Type Authorisation Restriction"@en ;
    era:shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/VehicleTypeAuthorisationRestrictionShape> ;
    dcterms:created "2025-02-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2025-07-15"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:source <https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2018/545/art_14/oj/eng#> ;
    rdfs:comment """Restrictions, like coded and non-coded conditions for use, to be taken into account in the context of a Vehicle (Type) Authorisation.

The restrictions are recorded by the Authorising Entities, possibly deduced during underlying verification and certification processes by competent bodies, and if possible are documented with a link
to the legal reference and sections therein.

In most cases, the Restriction will be dependent of a VehicleTypeConfiguration."""@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy era: ;
    rdfs:subClassOf era:Restriction ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" .

