- Removed the legacy enumerated values ("Y","N","Optional") from the ontology.
- Updated SHACL validation to require a boolean value (true/false).
- Aligned the parameter with its RINF definition as a binary required / not required indication.
- Updated version number to v3.1.7 and prior version to v3.1.6

